			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"星火"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210080000,
					"content": "火把怎麼又熄滅了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080001
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080001,
					"content": "火把怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080002
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210080002,
					"content": "#哦，是旅行者啊…{F#妳}{M#你}往前看，是不是能看見三座瞭望台？那上面本來應該燃著火把…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080003,
					"content": "歸離原的道路都很不好走，而且還有很多怪物躲藏。火把一方面是為行人們照亮道路，另一方面，燃起火把也是表示沒有怪物的威脅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080004,
					"content": "但是…我忙著去周圍清除怪物，偏偏忘了幫火把續火，等我發現的時候，已經全都熄滅了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2100801,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": []
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"星火"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210080101,
					"content": "你為什麼不自己去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210080102,
					"content": "呃，是這樣的，會有人來抽查火把的情況…我在這裡還能拖一拖時間…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080103,
					"content": "#要是{F#妳}{M#你}站在這，或者這裡根本沒人，那不就糟糕了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080104,
					"content": "#所以，拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了旅行者！去點燃火把吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2100802,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2100801
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": []
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"星火"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 210080201,
					"content": "交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210080202,
					"content": "#那就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080203,
					"content": "這條路上有三座嘹望塔，每座塔上分別有一個火盆。把它們都點燃以後，回來跟我說一聲就行了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080204,
					"content": "#在道路的盡頭，有一座「七天神像」。{F#妳}{M#你}或許可以順道供奉一下，那可是岩王爺的護佑啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210080205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				},
				{
					"id": 210080205,
					"content": "#無論怎樣……這件事就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了，順路的時候記得過去看看，別忘了哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "星火"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2100803,
